{
  "id": "new-browser-tab",
  "tier": "T1",
  "description": "New Chromium tab (cef-tab-bench.py): Cmd-Shift-L and openBrowser with a page, in a pane with and without a Chromium window, input to the frame that shows the tab, to its toolbar and page view, and to the page's first pixels, light session. The WebKit arm is new-browser-tab-webkit.",
  "command": ["scripts/cmux-next/cef-tab-bench.py", "--sessions", "light",
